---
import { SITE_CONTACT } from "@/consts";
import Layout from "./_layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy Policy for our website">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>
      Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy outlines how we
      collect, use, and protect the personal information you provide when using
      our website.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc py-8 space-y-4 max-w-screen-md mx-auto text-gray-700">
      <li>
        When you submit a message through our contact form, we collect the
        following personal information: Name, Email, and Phone number.
      </li>
      <li>
        We use the information you provide solely for the purpose of responding
        to your inquiries and following up on contact form submissions. We do
        not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties.
      </li>
      <li>
        We retain contact form submissions only as long as necessary to respond
        to your message or for customer service purposes.
      </li>
      <li>
        We take reasonable precautions to protect your personal information from
        unauthorized access, use, or disclosure.
      </li>
      <li>
        By using our contact form, you consent to the collection and use of your
        information as described in this policy.
      </li>
      <li>
        We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be
        posted on this page.
      </li>
      <li>
        If you have any questions about this policy, please contact us at [{
          SITE_CONTACT.email
        }].
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
